#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:10002
#: 9d3a3e92821848218ea6f3cbbf798329
msgid "SpectrogramMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "SpectrogramMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:10004
#: ad39706b69b44d81b47c5165dd137f6d
msgid ""
"This notebook introduces the basic usage of the `SpectrogramMatrix` class in"
" `gwexpy`."
msgstr "このノートブックでは `gwexpy` の `SpectrogramMatrix` クラスの基本的な使い方を紹介します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:10006
#: 9e5804d0477d46808693d373bace8cec
msgid ""
"`SpectrogramMatrix` is a class designed to efficiently handle multiple "
"`gwpy.spectrogram.Spectrogram` objects as a 3-dimensional matrix (Batch, "
"Time, Frequency). It inherits from `numpy.ndarray`, enabling fast numerical "
"computation and seamless integration with PyTorch/CuPy."
msgstr ""
"`SpectrogramMatrix` は、複数の `gwpy.spectrogram.Spectrogram` オブジェクトを 3次元 (Batch,"
" Time, Frequency) の行列として効率的に扱うためのクラスです。`numpy.ndarray` を継承しており、高速な数値計算や "
"PyTorch/CuPy との連携が可能です。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:30002
#: 05aa10db13b049f6abee831a64bfaf4e
msgid "1. Data Preparation"
msgstr "1. データの準備"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:50002
#: 47706a041df74607863fb50730a1c561
msgid "2. Creating a SpectrogramMatrix"
msgstr "2. SpectrogramMatrix の作成"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:50004
#: 70a28efaaa8c4e2f87cf63cf5621ec5f
msgid ""
"Using the `to_matrix()` method of `SpectrogramList`, all spectrograms are "
"stacked into a single `SpectrogramMatrix`. This yields a 3-dimensional array"
" with shape `(N, Time, Frequency)`."
msgstr ""
"`SpectrogramList` の `to_matrix()` メソッドを使用すると、全てのスペクトログラムが一つの "
"`SpectrogramMatrix` にスタックされます。 これにより、形状が `(N, Time, Frequency)` "
"の3次元配列が得られます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:70002
#: c8f75a98b0784d158032d900a1556cc0
msgid "Accessing Attributes"
msgstr "属性へのアクセス"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:70003
#: 309676ac354a454c97936e1df1083c56
msgid ""
"`SpectrogramMatrix` preserves information about the time and frequency axes "
"from the original spectrograms."
msgstr "`SpectrogramMatrix` は元のスペクトログラムの時間軸や周波数軸の情報を保持しています。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:90002
#: fd7b807eeb3345afad4ecebd8c963153
msgid "3. Numerical Computation and Statistics"
msgstr "3. 数値計算と統計"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:90004
#: 2b021d160efe4f6b9eb3d596fcb4283a
msgid ""
"Since `SpectrogramMatrix` is a subclass of `numpy.ndarray`, NumPy functions "
"can be applied directly. Methods like `mean()` are also available."
msgstr ""
"`SpectrogramMatrix` は `numpy.ndarray` のサブクラスであるため、Numpy の関数をそのまま適用できます。 "
"また、`mean()` などのメソッドも利用可能です。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:90007
#: 5f8c6efdf865499a9d229619fbb2b87d
msgid ""
"For example, let's calculate the average spectrogram across all channels "
"(batch dimension)."
msgstr "例えば、全チャネル（バッチ方向）の平均スペクトログラムを計算してみましょう。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:110002
#: f7cf9ba0177449fca93c1ff7bfd982d3
msgid "4. Plotting"
msgstr "4. プロット"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:110004
#: 371233de54f24a0aa8fb5bb20095626d
msgid ""
"Use the `plot()` method to visualize the data. When calling `plot()` on "
"3-dimensional data (Batch, Time, Freq), by default the **mean across the "
"batch dimension** is plotted. This is useful for examining the average "
"characteristics across multiple events."
msgstr ""
"`plot()` メソッドを使用すると、データを可視化できます。 3次元データ（Batch, Time, Freq）に対して `plot()` "
"を呼び出すと、デフォルトでは**バッチ方向の平均**がプロットされます。 これは複数のイベントの平均的な特徴を確認するのに便利です。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:130002
#: a9bf45daef234fc8b1f6708ca2c9797b
msgid ""
"To plot only a specific channel, specify an index using the `monitor` "
"argument."
msgstr "特定のチャネルだけをプロットしたい場合は、`monitor` 引数にインデックスを指定します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:150002
#: fd8ad29a03064b7cb664519296288f18
msgid "5. Integration with External Libraries"
msgstr "5. 外部ライブラリとの連携"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:150004
#: 0aab2ab0228344a29b31db33485ff473
msgid ""
"For machine learning or GPU computing, the data can be easily converted to "
"PyTorch or CuPy tensors."
msgstr "機械学習やGPU計算のために、PyTorch や CuPy のテンソルへ簡単に変換できます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:170002
#: f674dd74e87540cca78500fe536d1c6d
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "まとめ"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:170004
#: d9a665337f1e4d8dbd1c08c54b08eea1
msgid ""
"**`SpectrogramMatrix`** can be created using `SpectrogramList.to_matrix()`."
msgstr "**`SpectrogramMatrix`** は `SpectrogramList.to_matrix()` で作成できます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:170005
#: 51862c4c11dc4f1a971e88b5b29f70d1
msgid "It holds data as a 3-dimensional array `(Batch, Time, Freq)`."
msgstr "3次元配列 `(Batch, Time, Freq)` としてデータを保持します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:170006
#: e6eb363d7d604fadb12f5cfe86d9a151
msgid ""
"Methods like `mean()` and `plot()` make it easy to aggregate and visualize "
"data."
msgstr "`mean()` や `plot()` メソッドで、データの集約や可視化が簡単に行えます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/matrix_spectrogram.ipynb:170007
#: ce739bc35540464cbdabdc126e9e5edf
msgid ""
"It serves as a useful intermediate format for passing data to deep learning "
"frameworks via methods like `to_torch()`."
msgstr "`to_torch()` などでディープラーニングフレームワークへデータを渡す際の中間形式としても有用です。"
